    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<div class=\"control-header\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n<div class=\"controls\">\n<div class=\"umb-property-editor db\">\n<div class=\"umb-property-editor umb-rte --initialized\">\n<div class=\"umb-rte-editor-con\">\n<p><strong>If your work relies on geotechnical testing, this comprehensive guide is for you.</strong></p>\n<p>In this guide we will walk you through the various stages of geotechnical investigations,<br>explaining how they provide essential data to inform your engineering decisions.<br><br></p>\n<p><em>Centreline Investigations&nbsp; |&nbsp; Borrowpit Investigations&nbsp; |&nbsp; Nuclear Densities</em><em>&nbsp; |&nbsp; Dynamic Cone Penetrometer&nbsp; |&nbsp; Deep Probe SuperHeavy&nbsp; |&nbsp; Test Pits&nbsp; |&nbsp; Soil Classifications&nbsp; |&nbsp; Load Testing&nbsp; |&nbsp; Exploration Drilling</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
